# Trivy misconfiguration exceptions — each entry is a deliberate, documented
# accepted risk. Keep this list minimal and justified; never blanket-ignore.

# AZU-0012: "Storage account network default action should be Deny."
# Accepted for FootballAI staging. Both Storage Accounts (application data +
# Terraform state) authenticate exclusively via Microsoft Entra (shared-key
# access is disabled, storage_use_azuread=true). Setting the network default
# action to Deny would require VNet integration / private endpoints for the
# Container Apps data plane and for GitHub Actions state access, which is out of
# scope for this student-subscription staging environment. Revisit if the
# environment is promoted toward production. Tracked for P6/hardening.
AZU-0012
